@startuml state-crypto-provider
title CryptoProvider Key Source Adapter — Availability State Machine
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor LightBlue
  BorderColor Navy
}

[*] --> Initializing : Application startup\nor hot-add (P12 / PC/SC)

state Initializing {
  [*] --> Loading : Load config / DB record
  Loading --> Probing : Open connection\n(PKCS#11 session / SICCT TCP / P12 load)
}

state Available {
  state "Operations routed here" as OPS
  state "Periodic health check" as HC
  OPS --> HC : health watchdog tick\n(every 30 s)
  HC --> OPS : check OK
}

state Unavailable {
  state "Error logged\nHealth: DOWN" as ERR
}

state Reconnecting {
  state "Exponential backoff\n1s → 30s max (FR-025)" as BACKOFF
}

Initializing --> Available : P12 loaded OK\nor PKCS#11 session open\nor SICCT session AKTIV\nor PC/SC card present
Initializing --> Unavailable : Initialization failed\n(wrong PIN, library missing,\nnetwork unreachable)

Available --> Unavailable : CKR_TOKEN_NOT_PRESENT (FR-019)\nor PC/SC card removed (FR-020)\nor P12 source removed from config

Available --> Reconnecting : SICCT TLS lost (FR-136)\nor PKCS#11 session closed

Reconnecting --> Available : Reconnect + VALIDATE OK\n(SICCT) or session re-open (PKCS#11)
Reconnecting --> Unavailable : Max retries exceeded\nor permanent error

Unavailable --> Reconnecting : Retry timer fires\n(SICCT: backoff cycle)\nor hot-reload event (P12 / PC/SC)

Unavailable --> [*] : Alias removed from config\nor terminal decommissioned

note right of Available
  Alias registered in CryptoProvider.listAliases()
  Health readiness: UP (FR-014)
  Audit log: operation result = SUCCESS
end note

note right of Unavailable
  Alias absent from listAliases()
  Health readiness: DOWN
  In-flight ops: fail with clear error (FR-015)
  Audit log: operation result = FAILURE
end note

@enduml
